      "content": "Single GPU Real-time proving is here. Introducing Zilkworm-Airbender with our alpha.5 release \nhttps://github.com/erigontech/zilkworm/releases/tag/v0.1.0-alpha.5\n\nIt's live on EthProofs\n```\n  The 1000-block run (26207876–26208875) proved and posted all 1000 blocks, and\n  every proof verified.\n\n┌──────────────┬─────────┬───────────────────┐\n│ zkvm:        │zilkworm │zkSyncOS by m.labs │\n│ Airbender v3 │ 1x5090  ├─────────┬─────────┤\n│              │         │ 1x5090  │ 4x5090  │\n├──────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼─────────┤\n│ Median       │  5.21 s │  5.42 s │  2.25 s │\n│ proving time │         │         │         │\n├──────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼─────────┤\n│ Median time  │  9.45 s │  9.42 s │  5.50 s │\n│ to proof     │         │         │         │\n├──────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼─────────┤\n│ Time to      │ 12.03 s │ 12.59 s │  7.44 s │\n│ proof, p90   │         │         │         │\n├──────────────┼─────────┼─────────┼─────────┤\n│ Within 12 s  │  89.6%  │  86.6%  │  98.4%  │\n└──────────────┴─────────┴─────────┴─────────┘\n\n```",
